// Whether the current token is in an operator set. A call may not sit as an
// argument to a call, so a `while` condition cannot test
// `str_in((import mulops), cur_text(pos))` directly; reading the token and
// asking the set is composed here, once, and each level of the grammar passes
// its own set from conf.id (mulops, addops, relops, shiftops).

op_at(int[] pos, string[] ops) {
  string s = cur_text(pos);
  int ok = str_in(ops, s);
} return int ok;
given expr_tokens {
  ([3], ["*", "/"]):(1)
  ([3], ["+", "-"]):(0)
}
